# Type scale

Card titles, body, captions, and section headings use `page-h2` / `page-h3` / `page-h4` / `page-body` / `page-caption` from `app/globals.css`.

When changing layout, spacing, or structure: keep those classes. Do not introduce ad-hoc `text-sm`, `text-[13px]`, or similar to squeeze a diagram.

If a layout cannot work without changing type size, ask before changing it.
